            "heading": "Women's Ring Size Guide",
            "content_source": "page",
            "page": "womens-rings-size-guide",
            "custom_html": "<p>Ensuring your ring fits perfectly is crucial for both comfort and appearance. Remember that finger size can change depending on the time of day and temperature. When measuring your finger, consider doing so at the end of the day and when your fingers are warm for the most accurate size.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid--center  grid--uniform grid--flush-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"grid__item medium-up--one-half text-center aos-init aos-animate\" data-aos=\"row-of-3\">\n                <div style=\"margin: 0 auto; max-width: 500px;\">\n                  <a class=\"btnlink\" href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1476/0022/files/MARCO_DAL_MASO_Ring_Size_Guide_Women_02.pdf?v=1613994880\"><div class=\"image-wrap text-spacing loaded\" style=\"height: 0; padding-bottom: 89.39071154665531%;\">\n                    <image-element data-aos=\"image-fade-in\" class=\"aos-init aos-animate\">\n                    <img src=\"//marcodalmaso.com/cdn/shop/files/Women_Hand3-3-2.jpg?v=1614330457&amp;width=1080\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"//marcodalmaso.com/cdn/shop/files/Women_Hand3-3-2.jpg?v=1614330457&amp;width=180 180w, //marcodalmaso.com/cdn/shop/files/Women_Hand3-3-2.jpg?v=1614330457&amp;width=360 360w, //marcodalmaso.com/cdn/shop/files/Women_Hand3-3-2.jpg?v=1614330457&amp;width=540 540w, //marcodalmaso.com/cdn/shop/files/Women_Hand3-3-2.jpg?v=1614330457&amp;width=720 720w, //marcodalmaso.com/cdn/shop/files/Women_Hand3-3-2.jpg?v=1614330457&amp;width=900 900w, //marcodalmaso.com/cdn/shop/files/Women_Hand3-3-2.jpg?v=1614330457&amp;width=1080 1080w\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\" image-element\" sizes=\"(min-width: 769px) 50vw, 100vw\">\n                    </image-element>\n                  </div>\n                  </a>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <br><br>\n            <h4>Women's Rings Size Chart</h4>\n            <div class=\"table-wrapper\">\n              <table>\n                <tbody>\