          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<h2>Tips For Measuring </h2>"
          }
        },
        "text_w6ejkE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<h4></h4><p><strong>Measure Multiple Times</strong> </p><p>For the most accurate results, measure your wrist, finger, or neck multiple times and take the average.</p><p><strong>Consider the Fit</strong>: </p><p>Think about how you like your jewelry to fit. Do you prefer a snug, comfortable, or loose fit? Adjust your measurements accordingly.</p><p><strong>Professional Help</strong>: </p><p>When in doubt, visit a professional jeweler to have your measurements taken accurately.</p><p>By following this guide, you can ensure that your luxury jewelry from MARCO DAL MASO fits perfectly, enhancing both comfort and style. If you have any questions or need further assistance, please don't hesitate to contact our customer service team.</p>"
          }
        }
